OL,3,GNEWSAHow charity is preparing children
OL,4,Aabout to start reception
OL,5,
OL,6,FA charitable project has set up classes
OL,7,Fto make sure children and their
OL,8,Ffamilies are ready for starting
OL,9,Freception at school.
OL,11,FToilet training, dressing, sitting
OL,12,Fstill and communicating needs are among
OL,13,Fthe skills being taught by teacher and
OL,14,Foutreach worker Catherine Desjardins
OL,15,Ffrom Manchester charity Family Action.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,410,400,260,160,0,100
