OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAHow charity is preparing children
OL,4,Aabout to start reception
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt comes after parenting charity
OL,7,FKindred Squared found the region had
OL,8,Fthe third highest proportion of
OL,9,Fchildren arriving into reception year
OL,10,Fin 2025 unprepared, with 39% of
OL,11,Fchildren were not school-ready upon
OL,12,Fentering reception in the North West,
OL,13,Fcompared with national average of 37%.
OL,15,F"We wanted to make sure every child was
OL,16,Fable to go into school on a level
OL,17,Ffooting," Desjardins said.
